# A table of types, which [[energy.pair_override]] gives a pair, is an
# integer field that D[distribute-midpoint] transports with the domains:
# charged.toml as written is accepted and runs, with no refusal in its log.
# RUN: mkdir -p %t/override && cd %t/override
# RUN: sed -e 's|Inputs/mixture.pdb|%S/Inputs/mixture.pdb|' -e '/^\[output\]/a log = "override.log"' \
